<title>UK: McAlpine profits jump in 1996.</title>
<headline>McAlpine profits jump in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.0		   vs 37.2 loss</p>
<p> Shr pre-excep (pence)  12.6		   vs 0.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.0		    vs same</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.0		    vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     9.4		    vs 23.5 loss</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excep	 11.2		   vs 3.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   593.6		  vs 757.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the civil engineering and construction company is Alfred McAlpine Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
